\newlabel{tab:trr_texture_baselines}{{IV}{6}{Texture representation comparison on the held-out subset ($N=5$). TRR achieves lower L2 error compared to classical texture baselines (MFCC temporal statistics, modulation spectrogram), suggesting that Gram-matrix features better capture effect-relevant texture characteristics for parameter retrieval}{table.caption.5}{}}
